It is submitted that despite the fact that the claimants led cogent evidence in support of their said contention, learned Tribunal has taken income of the deceased as only Rs.9,000/- per month;
b) that nothing has been granted by way of future prospects and even amounts granted under loss of love & affection are on lower side and not as per law;
c) that interest has been granted only @ 6% whereas the same deserves to be enhanced to 12% and nothing has been given for child care.
4. No other argument is raised on behalf of the appellants.
5. I have heard learned counsel for the appellants.
